{
  "label": "tsuneyodorm10",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label tsuneyodorm10:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo, are you in there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let’s hang out.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I hear a set of footsteps quietly approach the door and stop right in front of it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why not? I’m bored and you’re not doing anything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m doing plenty of things.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What could you possibly be doing in there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Homework.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t give you any homework.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Noodle homework.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...What the fuck does that even mean?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Studying different types of wheat.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why not?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Put your noodles on hold for a few minutes and talk to me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please enter.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thank you...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo unlocks the door and I make my way into the room, stepping over a few plastic bags piled near the entrance along the way.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten1.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey. What’s up with the pajamas?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean like...They’re cute and everything...but what’s up with that smiley face?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s kind of creepy, don’t you think?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten2.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s a normal smile. Don't make fun of my clothes just because you hate joy.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t hate joy.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten1.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then why don’t you ever smile?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should try to be like this shirt. But with more energy and less cotton.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re the last person I want to hear about energy from. You have like three facial expressions.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you come here to fight?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? No. I was just going along with your banter.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, I think you look cute. Even if your shirt is a little weird.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten3.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Weird?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...Not weird. Just different.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That doesn’t sound any better.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten1.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This shirt was a gift from my father and I would greatly appreciate it if you would keep your comments to yourself.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am embarrassed enough to be seen like this in general.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t look very embarrassed to me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's because I only have three facial expressions. You said it yourself.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Yeah, but I feel like one of those is actually the embarrassed one.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo seems fine to me. Sure, her posture is a little different than normal, but it’s not like she’s curled up in the corner or anything.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten4.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So is there a real reason for your appearance today? Or is it just to hurt me?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not here to hurt you...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have the eyes of a man who is here to hurt a quirky noodle-girl.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know Kendo. I can kill you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know you do. It’s one of your two defining interests.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten5.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tsuneyo Tojo, Soup Warrior.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What happened to ‘Samurai of Flavor?’",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Samurai by day, warrior by night.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, at least you know what you’re into. That’s more than I can say for myself.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten6.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh, right. You are the man who loves nothing.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You said that at the restaurant the other day when the girl with the strange eyes asked you to list the things you enjoyed.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The man who loves nothing, huh?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s a pretty badass nickname.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Depressing, sure. But still cool.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can live with this.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That's right. I hate everything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Speaking of Kaori, though, have you run into her at all since then?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten7.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think she was looking around my backyard the other day.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that legal?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably not.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten8.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is she dangerous? Do I need to call the police?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She seems rather frail, so I could probably snap her neck instead if that’s easier.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, well definitely don’t do that. Kaori isn’t evil, she’s just...weird.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She probably just thinks it was strange that you wouldn’t hire her.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The Soup Warrior needs no assistance. Just time and ingredients.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And your father is totally cool with that? He doesn’t think you need any more help?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten9.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He has not weighed in on the matter. This is a decision I made for myself.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My father has had a profound influence on the way I approach life, but he does not decide everything for me.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Weren’t you just saying the other day how you tell him virtually everything you do?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. But not because he asks. It’s because I want to.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it wrong to share your feelings with the person you love?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten10.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, don’t answer that.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You do not love anyone or anything. I’m sorry if my question offended you.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow, you didn’t even give me a chance to respond that time.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sometimes, I accidentally think you’re a normal person and say more than I should.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why is it that every time you address me, I feel myself becoming less and less human?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten11.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Were you ever human to begin with?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is exactly what I'm talking about.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But what about you, Tsuneyo? Are you human?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is anyone human?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or are we all simply objects put here for the enjoyment of some higher power?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Left to wander the earth in search of the ultimate flavor combination.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That was actually a pretty thought-provoking question until you got to the flavor part.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My father’s words. The flavor part was what I added to it.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think it makes it more interesting. And delicious.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten12.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Tsuneyo moves over to her bed and sits down, bringing one of her hands to her arm and clutching it gently to steady the nerves that I imagine she's buried deep down inside somewhere.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She hasn’t really shown much emotion at all since I’ve met her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And sure, maybe that’s just her personality...But maybe it’s something more than that?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She has no problems talking about her father, it seems.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maybe he is the key to her heart?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten13.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why did you follow me to my bed?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because we were in the middle of a conversation. Was I not supposed to?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d personally feel more comfortable if you stood by the door.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I’m already here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are any of us really here?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re pretty philosophical today for someone who has already admitted to that not being a strong point.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And you’re a bitch.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did Molly teach you that word as well?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene tsuneyodormten14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/tsuneyodormten14.webp",
      "alt": "tsuneyodormten14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did I use it correctly?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t need to do push-ups to break a curse this time, do I?",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. Just try not to use that to anyone you don’t inherently dislike. It’s not exactly a great word.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Understood, bitch.",
      "spk": "Tsuneyo",
      "spkColor": "#C8B330",
